        <mxCell id="note2" value="1. Every claim must reference source documents (traceability)&#xa;2. Hypotheses require minimum 2 supporting documents&#xa;3. All embeddings use same model (384-dim)&#xa;4. Document chunks: 500 tokens with 100 token overlap&#xa;5. Retrieval precision target: 0.6 at top-5 (92% actual)&#xa;6. Analysis reliability score: 0.8-1.0 for RCTs, 0.3-0.5 for case studies&#xa;7. Reports must include medical disclaimer" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
